# AI-6E.0 — Agent Role Contracts & Collaboration Protocol

AGNES has completed:

* AI-6A revision safety foundation;
* AI-6B Multi-Agent Foundation;
* AI-6C contextual Agent UX;
* AI-6D Director Proposal Runtime;
* AI-6D.1 Agent UX Visual Polish & Proposal State Cohesion.

The next real capability phase will be:

**AI-6E — Production Planner Runtime**

Before implementing that capability, perform one small contract-hardening phase:

> **AI-6E.0 — Agent Role Contracts & Collaboration Protocol**

This is primarily a documentation and architecture-alignment phase.

It must NOT become another Agent runtime rewrite.

The purpose is to establish durable, explicit operating contracts for all eight existing AGNES Agents before more Specialists receive real execution capabilities.

---

