Before changing anything:

```bash
git status
git diff --stat
git log --oneline -15
```

Confirm that the completed AI-6D.1 changes are understood and isolated.

Do not reset, clean, checkout, discard, or overwrite unrelated user work.

Do not mix unrelated backend changes into this phase.

