# 3. Core invariant

The existing architecture remains:

```text
Agent
= reasoning / decision layer

Capability
= controlled semantic action surface

Workflow / Service
= deterministic execution

Project / Workspace
= shared structured state

AgentTask
= inter-agent coordination record

JobQueue / Dependency / Checkpoint
= execution rules
```

Do not replace deterministic workflow behavior with LLM judgment.

Do not introduce a new Agent framework.

