The success condition is NOT:

> "There are eight nice descriptions of AI personalities."

The success condition is:

> **Every AGNES Agent now has a precise operating contract defining what it owns, what it must not do, what context it receives, what capabilities it may use, what structured result it produces, when its work is complete, and how its output becomes safe input for the next stage without blurring responsibility between Specialists.**

Stop after the contracts and consistency audit are complete.

Do not begin Production Planner Runtime in this phase.
